## Problem

The `SolutionValidator` was tightly coupled to the `NetworkSimplex` class in `Graph.Lemon`, preventing its use with other solver implementations like `CostScaling`, `OrToolsSolver`, etc. This violated separation of concerns since solution validation is a general-purpose capability that should be available to all solvers.

## Changes Made

### 1. Extended IMinCostFlowSolver Interface
Added missing methods required by the validator:
```csharp
public interface IMinCostFlowSolver
{
