    long GetNodeSupply(int node);
    long GetArcCost(int arc);
    long GetArcLowerBound(int arc);
    long GetArcUpperBound(int arc);
}
```

### 2. Moved Core Components
- **From:** `src/Graph.Lemon/Validation/SolutionValidator.cs`
- **To:** `src/Graph.Core/Validation/SolutionValidator.cs`
- **From:** `src/Graph.Lemon/Validation/ValidationResult.cs`
- **To:** `src/Graph.Core/Validation/ValidationResult.cs`

### 3. Refactored Constructor
**Before:**
```csharp
public class SolutionValidator(IGraph graph, NetworkSimplex solver)
```

**After:**
