public class SolutionValidator(IGraph graph, IMinCostFlowSolver solver)
```

### 4. Updated Tests and References
- Moved tests to `src/Graph.Tests.Core/Validation/`
- Updated all namespace imports from `Graph.Lemon.Validation` to `Graph.Core.Validation`
- Implemented new interface methods in `CostScaling` algorithm

## Benefits

✅ **Universal Validation**: Any `IMinCostFlowSolver` implementation can now use the same validator  
✅ **Better Architecture**: Validation logic is properly separated from algorithm-specific code  
✅ **Extensibility**: Future solver implementations automatically get validation capabilities  
✅ **Consistency**: All solvers use the same validation logic and error reporting  

## Example Usage

```csharp
