  // Stream status check via API
}, [hostIP, hostPort, activeTab, dispatch]);
```

This ensures:
- Stream status is re-checked when switching between detector tabs
- The stream indicator shows the correct state for the active detector
- Follows React hooks best practices by including all dependencies

