✅ **Bloom mode texture coordinates work within shader distance limits**  
✅ **No more warning sounds when pressing 'S' to cycle modes**  
✅ **Cleaner codebase** - removed unused wireframe generation code  
✅ **All 99 tests pass** - no regressions introduced  

